# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
# A drag zoom follows the pointer's vertical motion (mitcad#1867, GitHub
# mitcad/Mitcad#330) on the demo block, in the middle-orbit scheme
# (Shift + middle zooms): straight up comes closer, straight down goes
# away, sideways alone keeps the zoom, and an upward drag that wobbles
# sideways comes closer at every step. Run by
# tools/ui-navigation-drag-zoom-test.sh (Linux),
# tools/ui-windows-navigation-drag-zoom-test.ps1 (Windows) and
# tools/ui-macos-navigation-drag-zoom-test.sh (macOS), in the Floating and
# the Docked layout.
wait-idle
expect-viewport
view-navigation middle-orbit
expect-drag-zoom
view-navigation middle-pan
expect-never '^(TestDriver: FAIL|OCCT view event failed)'
